{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed with your corporate-issued mining tool. Mine and deposit ores to afford items and upgrades to assist you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to submit quota. Fail, and you will be forgotten. Succeed, and you receive a replenished corporate-issued tool, because only the best bots may continue digging.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686370?t=1749497939","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686370/0e37454f5e0c5a5b2940dc67fe59d1894f5d90bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749497939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686370/a80eede188f7b96a821633d5b0ddd0f03fd68adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749497939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686370/a80eede188f7b96a821633d5b0ddd0f03fd68adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749497939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed